<title>USA: Noranda cuts U.S. aluminum price for Nov.</title>
<headline>Noranda cuts U.S. aluminum price for Nov.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Aluminum Inc has cut its U.S. aluminum ingot and billet list prices by two cents for all shipments beginning November 1.</p>
<p>The new ingot price is 70 cents per pound, with billet at 80 cents per pound.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
